WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.000
Part 1: build the platform.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.728
We'll start with the
architecture: the cluster,

3
00:00:04.728 --> 00:00:08.175
its components, how to size it
and make it highly available.

4
00:00:08.175 --> 00:00:12.263
Then the FIPS posture, where you have
to be careful about what you claim.

5
00:00:12.263 --> 00:00:15.074
Then how administrators
sign in to the console.

6
00:00:15.074 --> 00:00:18.636
And finally hardening,
least-privilege service accounts,

7
00:00:18.636 --> 00:00:21.900
and backup and recovery for
the database and its keys.

8
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:27.799
Sources: CyberArk 26.1 System Requirements,
Installation and Upgrade Guide,

9
00:00:27.799 --> 00:00:33.136
security hardening and disaster
recovery documentation; NIST CMVP;

10
00:00:33.136 --> 00:00:37.610
the Federal Modernization
Workbook's Book 07, Chapter 05.
